Error [E0764]: `nothing` has no parameter labelled `value`
  --> named_arg_diagnostic_covers_zero_parameter_calls.jet:2:20
    |
  2 | fn run() { nothing(value: 1) }
    |                    ^^^^^
 Why: A label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: `nothing` takes no labelled arguments
